  "_why": "LEVEL 7, WARDENS (NIGHT25, builder C; authored geometry in Tools/night/levels67-kits.py): the shield kind in earnest and a recap. Room 1, THE GATEHOUSE, is a breath (a gate wall with a 12 m gap). Room 2, THE WARD LANES: dense N-S cover lanes where wardens walk. Room 3, THE FISTWORKS, is meleeOnly: a grid of tight pillars, and a pit on the east side whose platform is reached by the ramp from the middle or by a pulse flick across the pit. Room 4, THE MINI GAUNTLET: every kind met so far in one arena with three heights (floor, a 2 m central deck, 4 m mezzanines).",
